1
00:01:43,610 --> 00:01:47,830
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:50,920
[Episode 12]

3
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:52,920
I called you here today

4
00:01:53,229 --> 00:01:55,470
to announce a piece of good news.

5
00:01:56,710 --> 00:01:58,280
We're having more and more

6
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,430
tourists,

7
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,860
and our influence is growing.

8
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,000
The county government

9
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,840
attaches great importance to our new

10
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,400
cultural tourism concept.

11
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,240
They especially offered us a spot

12
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:12,100
for one of us to go out
and attend a training program.

13
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,630
I decided to go

14
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:18,230
and seize this opportunity.

15
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:20,310
I won't let you

16
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:21,510
and the leaders down.

17
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:22,440
So, it's you.

18
00:02:24,150 --> 00:02:25,150
Okay.

19
00:02:25,790 --> 00:02:27,750
You're the one who's going to
attend the training program.

20
00:02:27,750 --> 00:02:29,150
Why did you call us for a meeting?

21
00:02:29,150 --> 00:02:30,630
This has nothing to do with us.

22
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:31,960
How can you say that?

23
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:32,560
After I leave,

24
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,430
we'll need an acting village chief,

25
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:35,070
right?

26
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:41,280
The village committee

27
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,600
and representatives

28
00:02:42,910 --> 00:02:43,840
have voted

29
00:02:44,150 --> 00:02:45,550
and unanimously elected

30
00:02:50,750 --> 00:02:51,950
Comrade Chen Jiahao,

31
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:54,090
the village committee member,

32
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,150
as the acting village chief!

33
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:57,120
Great!

34
00:02:57,150 --> 00:03:02,240
Chen Jiahao!

35
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:03,910
I think...

36
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:05,140
Wait a moment.

37
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:07,280
I haven't finished.

38
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:08,560
Zhen,

39
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:11,280
your mission as Zhu Geliang
(the strategist) is going to be hard.

40
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,410
Don't worry, Chief.

41
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,210
Chief, don't worry.

42
00:03:14,470 --> 00:03:16,000
With Zhuge Liang by my side,

43
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,710
I'll definitely be a good
Liu Bei (the wise leader).

44
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:19,910
You're Adou (the incompetent leader).

45
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,480
When are you leaving?

46
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:22,520
No rush.

47
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:25,520
Today is a day of triple blessings!

48
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:27,470
There's another piece of good news.

49
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:28,520
There's more?

50
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,579
Triple blessings?

51
00:03:29,910 --> 00:03:31,440
A film company from outside

52
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:33,240
contacted our village committee.

53
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:35,430
They said that
after watching our short film,

54
00:03:35,430 --> 00:03:38,400
they decided to adapt it into a big movie

55
00:03:38,590 --> 00:03:41,390
and wanted to invite
Mr. Zhou Ke to be the director!

56
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:42,840
Ke!

57
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,640
They want you!

58
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:44,590
Ke!

59
00:03:45,470 --> 00:03:47,280
Movie director!

60
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:48,910
Congratulations!

61
00:03:48,910 --> 00:03:50,070
Congratulations!

62
00:03:50,070 --> 00:03:51,120
Congratulations!

63
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,360
What a talent!

64
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,560
Do you really trust your brother

65
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,290
to be the acting village chief?

66
00:03:58,590 --> 00:04:00,910
It's fine. We'll all help him.

67
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,270
By the way, when are you leaving?

68
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,740
In a couple of days.

69
00:04:06,870 --> 00:04:08,360
I'm still making an appointment

70
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,420
with the investor.

71
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,480
You know,

72
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:17,950
without you,

73
00:04:17,950 --> 00:04:19,160
the film wouldn't even exist,

74
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:21,560
and the investor wouldn't have noticed me.

75
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,270
Have you thought about

76
00:04:24,270 --> 00:04:25,390
going with me?

77
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:28,970
What if we could work together
on this movie?

78
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,350
Wouldn't that be great?

79
00:04:30,390 --> 00:04:31,800
I don't know how to make movies.

80
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,270
What's the point of going with you?

81
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:34,000
Besides,

82
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,870
I don't like the city.

83
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,080
That's right.

84
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:41,140
Your tourism business is taking off.

85
00:04:41,310 --> 00:04:41,770
Indeed.

86
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,800
That's right.

87
00:04:53,710 --> 00:04:54,860
It's okay!

88
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:55,800
I believe in you.

89
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,530
You can do it!

90
00:04:56,830 --> 00:04:57,430
One day,

91
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:59,920
you'll become
the greatest director in the world,

92
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,750
and you'll make countless

93
00:05:01,750 --> 00:05:02,480
great movies.

94
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,160
Then all the villagers and I

95
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,240
will watch your movies.

96
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,950
Thanks! I can do it!

97
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:08,240
You can do it too!

98
00:05:08,390 --> 00:05:09,870
You'll definitely become
the greatest fish ball maker

99
00:05:09,870 --> 00:05:12,040
in the world

100
00:05:12,190 --> 00:05:13,510
and promote Zhen's Fish Ball

101
00:05:13,510 --> 00:05:14,870
to the whole world and universe!

102
00:05:14,870 --> 00:05:16,560
Even aliens will love it!

103
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:17,210
Thanks!

104
00:05:17,660 --> 00:05:18,360
When that time comes,

105
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,770
wherever you eat Zhen's Fish Ball,

106
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,270
I'll give you a 2% discount!

107
00:05:22,270 --> 00:05:22,730
No need.

108
00:05:22,950 --> 00:05:24,040
I'll be the greatest director,

109
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,950
I'll pay in full.

110
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:25,700
I'll treat the whole crew.

111
00:05:25,700 --> 00:05:28,630
People can eat Zhen's Fish Ball
and get a free movie ticket.

112
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:29,960
When you become famous,

113
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:31,800
don't forget your old friends.

114
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,040
Don't forget us.

115
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:33,510
I won't.

116
00:05:38,150 --> 00:05:39,070
I swear.

117
00:05:49,740 --> 00:05:50,340
Thank you.

118
00:05:54,390 --> 00:05:55,040
Thank you.

119
00:06:02,510 --> 00:06:03,310
Thank you too.

120
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,720
Ke, are we really leaving like this

121
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,390
without telling anyone?

122
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:30,040
Jiahao is quite busy
as the acting village chief.

123
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:32,120
Zhen's cultural tourism is taking off,

124
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:32,920
so she must be busy too.

125
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,240
Let's not hold them up.

126
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:35,070
Okay.

127
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:38,120
Then we'll leave quietly,

128
00:06:38,390 --> 00:06:40,630
just as we came quietly.

129
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,980
Waving our sleeves...

130
00:06:42,830 --> 00:06:44,360
Not taking away a single...

131
00:06:44,870 --> 00:06:45,560
local specialty.

132
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:47,190
No specialty.

133
00:06:47,230 --> 00:06:47,670
No.

134
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:58,830
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

135
00:06:59,070 --> 00:07:03,240
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

136
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:07,310
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

137
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:11,510
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

138
00:07:11,510 --> 00:07:15,040
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

139
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:18,560
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

140
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:22,630
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

141
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:24,970
No more! No need!

142
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,720
Mr. Shark.

143
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:27,230
Thank you.

144
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,090
No need for this!

145
00:07:30,750 --> 00:07:33,720
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

146
00:07:34,950 --> 00:07:36,430
We're leaving. You don't have to do this.

147
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:37,240
Mr. Zhou.

148
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,370
Take this, Mr. Zhou.

149
00:07:39,270 --> 00:07:39,920
Don't be so polite.

150
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:40,480
Stop here.

151
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,210
That's enough. We're leaving.

152
00:07:43,510 --> 00:07:44,480
Okay, Qingxia.

153
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:45,310
Mr. Zhou.

154
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:46,950
Take care.

155
00:07:47,310 --> 00:07:48,950
This will always be your second home.

156
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:52,120
Goodbye, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

157
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:53,680
Thanks.

158
00:07:59,000 --> 00:07:59,510
Ke,

159
00:08:00,430 --> 00:08:01,360
come back often.

160
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,120
I will.

161
00:08:09,250 --> 00:08:10,310
-Miss Qingxia.
-Come back often.

162
00:08:10,310 --> 00:08:11,830
I'll miss you. I'll miss you.

163
00:08:11,830 --> 00:08:13,030
Okay, that's enough.

164
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:14,430
We're leaving now.

165
00:08:14,430 --> 00:08:15,310
Have a safe trip!

166
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:16,360
Take care!

167
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,090
Just go back.

168
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,480
We're leaving. Remember to call me.

169
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,210
I'm leaving.

170
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:19,870
Okay.

171
00:08:19,870 --> 00:08:20,680
Call me!

172
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,190
Ximei!

173
00:08:31,630 --> 00:08:32,480
Ximei!

174
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,750
Ximei!

175
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,440
Ximei!

176
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,360
Ximei!

177
00:08:41,230 --> 00:08:44,350
Can't I be the reason you stay?

178
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,250
In TV dramas, they always catch up.

179
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:51,120
But he still couldn't catch up.

180
00:08:53,910 --> 00:08:55,790
Why didn't you wake me up?

181
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:58,390
You drank a lot to drown your sorrows
last night. How can you blame us?

182
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:00,270
I told you drinking would only
make you mess things up.

183
00:09:00,270 --> 00:09:01,150
Wait, Junnan.

184
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,290
When you become famous,

185
00:09:19,390 --> 00:09:20,720
don't forget us.

186
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,240
I won't.

187
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,330
I swear.

188
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,800
How could I possibly forget?

189
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:37,320
♪ Memories are like endless rain ♪

190
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:36,750
I really think

191
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:39,240
this is the most beautiful encounter.

192
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:42,070
♪ I hold my umbrella,
but still get soaked ♪

193
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:40,800
Get lost.

194
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:43,810
If you don't get out of our village today,

195
00:09:42,450 --> 00:09:45,320
♪ Loving you without telling the world ♪

196
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,790
I'll make you stay here forever.

197
00:09:45,610 --> 00:09:48,320
♪ It's funny, actually ♪

198
00:09:47,030 --> 00:09:48,030
I'll protect you.

199
00:09:48,750 --> 00:09:51,970
♪ At least at night,
I have these thoughts ♪

200
00:09:48,910 --> 00:09:50,030
I didn't expect you

201
00:09:50,030 --> 00:09:51,490
to be so capable, Mr. Zhou.

202
00:09:51,980 --> 00:09:55,100
♪ To keep me company in the silence ♪

203
00:09:56,690 --> 00:10:02,830
♪ I was just a little short on luck ♪

204
00:10:01,660 --> 00:10:03,210
From now on, I'll tell everyone

205
00:10:03,210 --> 00:10:07,140
♪ But that's okay, I'm still learning ♪

206
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,790
that I met a

207
00:10:05,390 --> 00:10:06,870
very reliable partner.

208
00:10:07,690 --> 00:10:10,650
♪ I've tamed love before ♪

209
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:15,240
♪ Yet I still can't accept
becoming a stranger to you ♪

210
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:21,140
♪ I could wait a century for you ♪

211
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:17,630
Mr. Zhou!

212
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:22,360
You can come out during the day?

213
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,310
♪ The longest dream I've ever had ♪

214
00:10:24,330 --> 00:10:27,820
♪ Is loving you
while hiding it from the world ♪

215
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:25,750
Mr. Zhou, you...

216
00:10:25,750 --> 00:10:27,550
No! Please don't!

217
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,390
To be honest,

218
00:10:28,110 --> 00:10:32,310
♪ Sharing this secret only with myself ♪

219
00:10:28,510 --> 00:10:28,970
I wanted

220
00:10:29,150 --> 00:10:29,790
to make your ceremony

221
00:10:29,790 --> 00:10:31,550
a bit more traditional.

222
00:10:31,870 --> 00:10:33,200
Therefore, I worked overnight
with the materials we had

223
00:10:32,780 --> 00:10:35,670
♪ It's because I'm not smart ♪

224
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,630
and made some creative changes.

225
00:10:34,630 --> 00:10:35,510
Let me show you.

226
00:10:36,060 --> 00:10:39,510
♪ And don't know how to deduce ♪

227
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,750
Zhen, you'll live in our memories forever.

228
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:39,200
Please rest in peace.

229
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,240
It can be Zhen

230
00:10:39,950 --> 00:10:46,600
♪ Figuring out the hidden meaning
when it's too late ♪

231
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,910
or any one of you!

232
00:10:41,910 --> 00:10:44,270
Isn't this also a way
to say goodbye to ourselves

233
00:10:44,270 --> 00:10:46,080
and show our determination
to take on challenges?

234
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,550
-Great!
-Well said!

235
00:10:46,890 --> 00:10:49,290
♪ The longest dream I've ever had ♪

236
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:52,740
♪ Is searching for you
all over the world ♪

237
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:52,870
Mr. Zhou,

238
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,270
you made a great point.

239
00:10:53,370 --> 00:10:58,030
♪ Following closely like the rhythm
of breathing ♪

240
00:10:54,270 --> 00:10:55,600
-Glad to work with you!
-Glad to work with you!

241
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:58,130
-Glad to work with you!
-Glad to work with you!

242
00:10:58,130 --> 00:11:01,300
♪ You are right there ♪

243
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,710
Shapu, Shapu!

244
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:01,840
Cheers!

245
00:11:01,330 --> 00:11:04,310
♪ So intimate ♪

246
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:02,960
You know,

247
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,240
without you,

248
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,360
the film wouldn't even exist,

249
00:11:04,330 --> 00:11:08,340
♪ Because fate has brought us here ♪

250
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:07,840
and the investor wouldn't have noticed me.

251
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,550
Have you thought about

252
00:11:08,930 --> 00:11:14,840
♪ Slowly scattering into the sky ♪

253
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:11,600
going with me?

254
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:15,840
If only

255
00:11:16,550 --> 00:11:17,600
I could be

256
00:11:18,510 --> 00:11:19,720
a little braver...

257
00:11:19,790 --> 00:11:20,440
Thank you.

258
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,600
Thank you.

259
00:11:38,870 --> 00:11:40,200
Why did you get two more bowls?

260
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,600
We can't finish three.

261
00:11:54,590 --> 00:12:02,650
[Shanqian Hotel]

262
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:55,670
Zhou Ke.

263
00:11:56,190 --> 00:11:58,050
Your old room has been rented out.

264
00:11:58,270 --> 00:11:59,910
Now only this room is vacant.

265
00:12:00,390 --> 00:12:01,840
If you weren't an acquaintance of mine,

266
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,150
I wouldn't want to rent this room out.

267
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:05,080
Okay, then we'll take this room.

268
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,240
We've been traveling all day.

269
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:10,440
We can finally get a good night's sleep.

270
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,420
This room is really nice.

271
00:12:13,420 --> 00:12:16,270
It's 50 yuan cheaper
than the one you rented before.

272
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:18,470
Why did you bring Zhen's padded jacket?

273
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,440
I'm used to wearing it.

274
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,370
So, I grabbed it.

275
00:12:22,250 --> 00:12:22,910
Let's unpack the rest.

276
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:23,240
Okay.

277
00:12:23,730 --> 00:12:24,880
Then wash it clean

278
00:12:24,910 --> 00:12:25,750
and send it back to her.

279
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:26,510
Well,

280
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:28,840
we're basically returning home in glory.

281
00:12:29,670 --> 00:12:31,440
Why do I feel so empty inside?

282
00:12:46,910 --> 00:12:47,910
Have you arrived?

283
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,550
How was the trip?

284
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:52,010
Everything went well.

285
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,000
We've already set up a meeting
at the company tomorrow

286
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,400
to discuss the contract.

287
00:12:56,550 --> 00:12:57,670
That's great.

288
00:12:57,790 --> 00:12:59,510
I knew you could do it.

289
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:02,600
Thank you.

290
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:04,200
It's also my first time dealing with

291
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,630
such a big producer.

292
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:06,790
Ms. Shiqi

293
00:13:06,810 --> 00:13:07,600
is a big shot.

294
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:09,030
She's invested in a lot of great movies.

295
00:13:09,030 --> 00:13:09,720
We're so lucky

296
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,000
she took an interest in our movie

297
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:11,950
this time.

298
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,550
That's awesome.

299
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:18,360
Good luck.

300
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:19,870
Rest early.

301
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,720
I'll wait for your good news.

302
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:22,960
Got it.

303
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,600
If this works out,

304
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:25,960
I'll definitely make Shapu Village

305
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,090
a filming location.

306
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,150
When are you going to pay back the money?

307
00:13:49,150 --> 00:13:52,150
If you don't pay by the deadline,
I won't go easy on you!

308
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,640
There are still three days left.

309
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:55,790
Stop barking like a dog.

310
00:13:55,790 --> 00:13:58,250
If you behave,
I'll pay you 10,000 yuan more.

311
00:13:59,750 --> 00:14:02,150
[Shapu Village Station]

312
00:14:25,270 --> 00:14:26,800
Zhen, Jiahao, you're here.

313
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,340
Good to see you.

314
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,680
Hello, Acting Chief.

315
00:14:32,710 --> 00:14:34,440
No need for these formalities.

316
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,440
Get back to your business.

317
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:35,960
Okay.

318
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:43,950
[King of Comedy Scene]

319
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:42,120
Will you support me if I don't?

320
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:43,860
Well said.

321
00:14:44,030 --> 00:14:45,430
Everything we have today

322
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:47,440
is thanks to

323
00:14:47,750 --> 00:14:48,280
Mr. Zhou.

324
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:50,750
Although he's left,

325
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:53,870
his spirit will always

326
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,050
remain.

327
00:14:57,030 --> 00:14:57,630
Wait, this...

328
00:14:57,630 --> 00:14:58,960
Can someone hold this?

329
00:14:59,370 --> 00:14:59,910
Coming.

330
00:15:00,030 --> 00:15:01,670
How could you let it fall?

331
00:15:01,670 --> 00:15:02,870
Look at this.

332
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,870
This is the most important thing.

333
00:15:04,870 --> 00:15:05,270
Right?

334
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,180
The commissary

335
00:15:09,670 --> 00:15:12,200
is really a treasured place
in Shapu Village.

336
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:14,430
Who took the lead to tear it down?

337
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:15,840
Who?

338
00:15:16,030 --> 00:15:16,320
Who?

339
00:15:17,910 --> 00:15:19,440
Why do you have to

340
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:20,640
bring that up?

341
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,080
I wasn't thinking straight.

342
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:25,510
Thanks to everyone's help

343
00:15:25,510 --> 00:15:26,870
and my brilliance,

344
00:15:27,390 --> 00:15:29,450
I can finally fulfill Dad's last wish

345
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:32,240
and lead the villagers to happiness.

346
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:34,910
Dad.

347
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:38,320
I think I'm catching up with you.

348
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:39,910
Our dad was the official chief.

349
00:15:39,910 --> 00:15:41,370
You're just an acting one.

350
00:15:41,630 --> 00:15:42,270
Well said.

351
00:15:43,390 --> 00:15:45,270
Why did he ask me to be the acting chief?

352
00:15:45,270 --> 00:15:46,910
Why didn't he ask someone else?

353
00:15:46,910 --> 00:15:47,910
He didn't ask her.

354
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:49,750
She's a tourist.

355
00:15:52,670 --> 00:15:53,440
Anyway,

356
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:55,130
he must've seen my ability.

357
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:02,270
Can you stop putting on such airs?

358
00:16:02,270 --> 00:16:03,200
Absolutely not.

359
00:16:03,270 --> 00:16:04,840
A new broom sweeps clean.

360
00:16:04,910 --> 00:16:06,640
I must establish my authority.

361
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:07,970
Don't make enemies.

362
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,270
Whoever stands against the villagers

363
00:16:10,270 --> 00:16:11,480
is my enemy.

364
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,270
Why should I be scared?

365
00:16:13,270 --> 00:16:14,930
You really take after our dad.

366
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,670
Like father, like son.

367
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:21,240
If it serves my country,
I'll risk my life without hesitation.

368
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:24,320
Why should I shrink from duty
for fear of hardship or harm?

369
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:27,360
Excerpt from my father's handwriting.

370
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:36,120
Just let me act cool, okay?

371
00:16:46,030 --> 00:16:48,670
Is everything going well with him?

372
00:17:00,150 --> 00:17:01,550
Ms. Shiqi, they're here.

373
00:17:02,750 --> 00:17:03,200
Sit.

374
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:10,069
Ms. Shiqi.

375
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:11,000
Hello.

376
00:17:11,030 --> 00:17:11,920
Hello.

377
00:17:12,270 --> 00:17:12,670
Hello.

378
00:17:13,550 --> 00:17:14,109
Sit.

379
00:17:14,829 --> 00:17:15,230
Hello.

380
00:17:15,589 --> 00:17:16,310
Take a seat.

381
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:17,500
You're so busy.

382
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,089
This one, right?

383
00:17:19,510 --> 00:17:20,960
Tri-fold phone. Never seen it before.

384
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:21,760
That's right.

385
00:17:25,790 --> 00:17:26,310
It's fine.

386
00:17:26,310 --> 00:17:27,720
Go ahead. I'm listening.

387
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:28,480
I'm dealing with something.

388
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,480
Okay.

389
00:17:30,030 --> 00:17:32,510
First of all, thank you, Ms. Shiqi,

390
00:17:32,790 --> 00:17:34,850
for taking an interest in our script.

391
00:17:35,270 --> 00:17:36,200
For this script,

392
00:17:36,350 --> 00:17:39,400
Zhou Ke is the screenwriter,
director, and actor.

393
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:41,440
Actually, he's under a lot of pressure.

394
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,750
But fortunately,

395
00:17:42,750 --> 00:17:43,750
our team

396
00:17:44,030 --> 00:17:46,110
has worked together

397
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:46,920
very well.

398
00:17:48,030 --> 00:17:50,200
The plan is very complete now.

399
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,400
First, we'll

400
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:53,070
talk about the style of this film.

401
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:53,400
Yes.

402
00:17:53,790 --> 00:17:55,750
-The style of our film...
-The style of our film...

403
00:17:55,750 --> 00:17:56,920
I want to refer to...

404
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:58,070
That's enough.

405
00:17:58,270 --> 00:17:59,470
I've read the script.

406
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,030
It's great.

407
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:02,070
Thank you so much.

408
00:18:02,070 --> 00:18:03,930
Young man, you're very talented.

409
00:18:04,270 --> 00:18:05,030
How old are you?

410
00:18:05,030 --> 00:18:06,000
Almost 30.

411
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:07,790
Not even 30?

412
00:18:07,790 --> 00:18:08,750
Almost.

413
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:10,370
That's amazing.

414
00:18:10,790 --> 00:18:11,440
You're under 30,

415
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:13,680
and you've written such an excellent work.

416
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:16,010
The plots and characters are so creative.

417
00:18:16,110 --> 00:18:17,400
The movie industry

418
00:18:17,420 --> 00:18:19,020
needs fresh blood like this!

419
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:20,310
Thank you so much.

420
00:18:20,310 --> 00:18:21,070
Thank you

421
00:18:21,070 --> 00:18:21,880
for giving us this opportunity.

422
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:24,310
We've heard so much about
your previous works.

423
00:18:24,310 --> 00:18:24,750
That's right.

424
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:26,310
Like "The Wandering Mars"

425
00:18:26,790 --> 00:18:27,680
and "Somebody."

426
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,310
I never imagined I could work with you.

427
00:18:29,310 --> 00:18:30,750
It's nothing.

428
00:18:30,990 --> 00:18:32,200
-So, today...
-This time...

429
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:34,200
Should I tell you more about our film?

430
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:35,530
I asked you to come today

431
00:18:35,830 --> 00:18:37,680
because I have some good news.

432
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:38,510
Good news?

433
00:18:38,510 --> 00:18:39,480
-Tell us about it.
-We're listening.

434
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:42,000
Guess who came to our company
a few days ago?

435
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:42,790
Who?

436
00:18:43,310 --> 00:18:43,880
Yi Luo.

437
00:18:44,270 --> 00:18:45,440
Which Yi Luo?

438
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:47,920
Who else could it be?

439
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,680
That Yi Luo!

440
00:18:50,070 --> 00:18:51,460
That Yi Luo?

441
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:52,400
He came?

442
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:53,330
Yes, that Yi Luo!

443
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:54,680
And then? What happened?

444
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,160
Well,

445
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:56,160
he read

446
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:58,160
your script.

447
00:18:58,640 --> 00:18:59,720
Then he said

448
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:00,850
it was well-written

449
00:19:01,030 --> 00:19:02,350
and insisted on playing the male lead!

450
00:19:02,350 --> 00:19:03,160
Really?

451
00:19:03,470 --> 00:19:05,110
Yi Luo wants to play the male lead?

452
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:05,550
Yes.

453
00:19:05,570 --> 00:19:06,170
Yi Luo?

454
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:06,880
Yes.

455
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:08,640
Oh my god, this is amazing!

456
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:09,880
This is great!

457
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:10,790
It's great.

458
00:19:10,790 --> 00:19:11,960
Do you think he's suitable?

459
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:12,920
This is awesome!

460
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:14,350
Let me put it another way.

461
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:16,160
If he plays the male lead... Actually,

462
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:18,110
being a screenwriter, director, and actor
at the same time is quite stressful.

463
00:19:18,110 --> 00:19:18,720
Now I can

464
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:20,440
-focus on directing.
-Exactly.

465
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:22,160
I'm glad that you think he's suitable.

466
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:22,830
You agree, right?

467
00:19:22,830 --> 00:19:24,240
Well, why would I say no?

468
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,400
How could I reject Yi Luo?

469
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:27,030
See? This director really has
a great vision.

470
00:19:27,030 --> 00:19:27,790
Thank you.

471
00:19:27,790 --> 00:19:29,110
There's another piece of good news.

472
00:19:29,110 --> 00:19:30,250
-More good news?
-There's more?

473
00:19:30,250 --> 00:19:31,770
Now we have Yi Luo, right?

474
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,530
He recommended a director.

475
00:19:34,030 --> 00:19:34,890
He recommended

476
00:19:35,270 --> 00:19:38,200
Yi Chou to be our director.

477
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:41,160
W-Which Yi Chou?

478
00:19:42,310 --> 00:19:43,070
That Yi...

479
00:19:44,130 --> 00:19:45,440
Are you serious?

480
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:46,510
Directing my...

481
00:19:46,510 --> 00:19:47,070
my film?

482
00:19:47,070 --> 00:19:48,030
O-Our film?

483
00:19:48,030 --> 00:19:49,550
-He's going to be the director?
-I'm shocked!

484
00:19:49,550 --> 00:19:51,720
This project is too big now!

485
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:52,440
Too big!

486
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:53,160
That's amazing! No problem!

487
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:53,830
I can accept it.

488
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:54,310
Don't worry.

489
00:19:54,310 --> 00:19:54,920
It's alright.

490
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:56,240
Calm down. Calm down.

491
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,750
I'll just stay behind the scenes
and serve them,

492
00:19:57,750 --> 00:19:58,750
-just focusing on the script.
-Yes.

493
00:19:58,750 --> 00:19:59,880
I'm fine with both of them.

494
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:00,480
That's right.

495
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,920
It's okay. No problem.

496
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:03,350
I'm telling you, the good news

497
00:20:03,350 --> 00:20:04,270
just keeps coming!

498
00:20:04,270 --> 00:20:05,830
I have another piece of good news!

499
00:20:05,830 --> 00:20:06,830
There's more?

500
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:09,110
There's another piece of good news!

501
00:20:09,110 --> 00:20:09,750
Tell us!

502
00:20:09,750 --> 00:20:11,440
Yi Chou is here.

503
00:20:11,590 --> 00:20:12,720
Director Yi Chou...

504
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,750
Director Yi Chou recommended

505
00:20:15,260 --> 00:20:16,630
Mr. Yi Dongxi

506
00:20:16,650 --> 00:20:18,150
to be our screenwriter!

507
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:20,640
Is Mr. Yi

508
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:22,440
writing again?

509
00:20:22,510 --> 00:20:25,110
He came out of retirement
just for our project.

510
00:20:25,110 --> 00:20:26,590
He's the kind of person money can't buy.

511
00:20:26,590 --> 00:20:27,470
Well, this...

512
00:20:27,510 --> 00:20:28,240
This lineup is top-notch!

513
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:29,270
Is it good? Are you satisfied?

514
00:20:29,270 --> 00:20:30,160
Thank you! Thank you so much!

515
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,220
You're so capable!

516
00:20:31,270 --> 00:20:32,350
I never imagined

517
00:20:32,350 --> 00:20:34,240
that such a good thing

518
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:35,720
would happen to us!

519
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:37,030
Tell me about it.

520
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:39,000
Are you okay with these three joining us?

521
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,110
-No problem.
-Wait a minute.

522
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:41,000
-Wait a minute.
-This...

523
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:41,480
Well...

524
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:43,350
Yi Luo, Yi Chou, and Yi Dongxi.

525
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:44,530
Something's wrong.

526
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,240
Well,

527
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:46,210
now that...

528
00:20:46,590 --> 00:20:48,110
we have actors, a director,
and a screenwriter,

529
00:20:48,110 --> 00:20:48,710
what's...

530
00:20:49,030 --> 00:20:49,890
my role in this?

531
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,210
Oh, that's right?

532
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:58,790
What's Zhou Ke's role in this project?

533
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,070
That's why I called you here

534
00:21:01,070 --> 00:21:02,590
to discuss it with you.

535
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:03,800
Let's...

536
00:21:05,270 --> 00:21:06,680
try to figure this out.

537
00:21:07,590 --> 00:21:09,960
We already have

538
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,440
a creative team.

539
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,220
We have a director,

540
00:21:13,590 --> 00:21:14,750
a screenwriter,

541
00:21:15,270 --> 00:21:16,480
and a male lead.

542
00:21:16,750 --> 00:21:18,920
So, I've been thinking

543
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:20,960
what position would be

544
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:23,200
suitable for Zhou Ke.

545
00:21:24,830 --> 00:21:26,360
After much consideration,

546
00:21:27,270 --> 00:21:30,330
I think there really isn't
a suitable position for him.

547
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:31,200
So...

548
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:35,520
Then why did you call us here?

549
00:21:36,240 --> 00:21:37,830
Well, how about this?

550
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:41,170
I'll buy the story's copyright

551
00:21:41,350 --> 00:21:42,280
from Mr. Zhou Ke.

552
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:44,200
Buy the copyright?

553
00:21:45,920 --> 00:21:49,350
I know a little
about your financial situation.

554
00:21:50,160 --> 00:21:51,510
You're not doing

555
00:21:53,110 --> 00:21:54,070
very well,

556
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:54,840
right?

557
00:21:55,210 --> 00:21:58,540
We'll definitely pay you at least

558
00:21:58,640 --> 00:22:00,040
double the market price.

559
00:22:00,270 --> 00:22:01,470
Is that okay with you?

560
00:22:05,750 --> 00:22:07,270
It's okay. Don't feel pressured.

561
00:22:07,270 --> 00:22:09,270
If that's not good enough,

562
00:22:09,270 --> 00:22:11,790
we can put your name in the end credits—

563
00:22:11,790 --> 00:22:13,240
"Thanks to Mr. Zhou Ke."

564
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:19,400
It's just that he did all the writing...

565
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:21,860
Don't worry.
If you're still not satisfied,

566
00:22:22,110 --> 00:22:24,160
we can put it in the end credits

567
00:22:24,550 --> 00:22:26,510
in huge letters,

568
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:29,510
"Special Thanks to Mr. Zhou Ke."

569
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,160
Is that okay with you?

570
00:22:34,660 --> 00:22:36,550
Ms. Shiqi, is there

571
00:22:36,550 --> 00:22:38,920
anything wrong?

572
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:41,590
Is it because we don't have
"Yi" in our names?

573
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:44,960
We can change his name to Zhou Yike.

574
00:22:46,310 --> 00:22:47,400
You can't do this.

575
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:48,590
He's really

576
