This one is just average.

1128
00:41:18,960 --> 00:41:21,110
But this one

1129
00:41:22,350 --> 00:41:23,710
is a bit different.

1130
00:41:29,020 --> 00:41:31,280
Are you really going to fake an accident?

1131
00:41:33,070 --> 00:41:34,190
I have no choice.

1132
00:41:34,800 --> 00:41:37,190
If I don't pay him back,
something bad will happen.

1133
00:41:37,190 --> 00:41:38,000
I can't let Chen Junnan

1134
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:39,600
sell the convenience store.

1135
00:41:40,080 --> 00:41:40,790
Let's do it.

1136
00:41:42,920 --> 00:41:43,550
Here it comes.

1137
00:41:43,550 --> 00:41:44,350
Here it comes.

1138
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:45,710
I'm so nervous.

1139
00:41:46,870 --> 00:41:48,400
We'll pretend to walk over there later.

1140
00:41:48,400 --> 00:41:48,960
Play along with me.

1141
00:41:48,960 --> 00:41:49,290
Okay.

1142
00:41:51,310 --> 00:41:51,750
Wait.

1143
00:41:52,510 --> 00:41:54,190
This one doesn't look rich.

1144
00:41:54,480 --> 00:41:56,280
Don't make things hard for them.

1145
00:42:02,070 --> 00:42:02,930
This is the one!

1146
00:42:05,800 --> 00:42:06,200
Go!

1147
00:42:10,030 --> 00:42:11,000
What's wrong with you?

1148
00:42:11,000 --> 00:42:13,070
Why didn't you slow down
at the speed bump?

1149
00:42:13,070 --> 00:42:14,000
I'm freaked out!

1150
00:42:14,150 --> 00:42:15,110
I could die!

1151
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:15,920
Are you okay, Ke?

1152
00:42:15,920 --> 00:42:16,670
Forget it.

1153
00:42:16,670 --> 00:42:18,150
Let's think of something else.

1154
00:42:18,150 --> 00:42:20,010
We really can't do this kind of...

1155
00:42:25,590 --> 00:42:26,830
Young man!

1156
00:42:26,960 --> 00:42:28,360
He got hit by a car!

1157
00:42:28,360 --> 00:42:29,190
Are you okay?

1158
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:31,210
-It hurts!
-Where does it hurt?

1159
00:42:32,190 --> 00:42:33,230
Help!

1160
00:42:33,440 --> 00:42:33,760
This...

1161
00:42:33,760 --> 00:42:35,360
Ambulance... It hit me...

1162
00:42:35,360 --> 00:42:37,360
Look what you've done.

1163
00:42:37,360 --> 00:42:38,710
He's seriously injured.

1164
00:42:38,710 --> 00:42:40,320
How much will you have to pay?

1165
00:42:40,670 --> 00:42:41,190
Zhou Ke?

1166
00:42:41,670 --> 00:42:42,550
Are you Zhou Ke?

1167
00:42:47,440 --> 00:42:48,440
Get up.

1168
00:42:48,440 --> 00:42:49,710
Take a good look at me.
Do you recognize me?
